OL,3,GNEWSAScaled-down Muslim cemetery plans
OL,4,Aresubmitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new Muslim cemetery near
OL,7,FPeterborough have been resubmitted
OL,8,Fafter being scaled back by about 80%
OL,9,Ffollowing concerns over an earlier
OL,10,Fapplication.
OL,12,FThe revised proposal by Green Meadows
OL,13,Fcharity would create a burial ground on
OL,14,F1.73 hectares (4.27 acres) of land off
OL,15,FOld Peterborough Road in Sutton,
OL,16,Freplacing a previous 8.5 hectares (21
OL,17,Facres) scheme.
OL,19,FThe applicant said the redesigned
OL,20,Fscheme addressed concerns while
OL,21,Fproviding "a dignified and accessible
OL,22,Fenvironment".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
