OL,3,GNEWSAScaled-down Muslim cemetery plans
OL,4,Aresubmitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original plans, submitted in 2024,
OL,7,Fincluded almost 8,500 burial plots, a
OL,8,Fceremony building, and landscaping. The
OL,9,Frevised scheme includes an informal
OL,10,Fburial layout, a 54-space car park, and
OL,11,Foutdoor ablution facilities.
